Package: ifix-device-support
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: iFix contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/Hackt1vator/iFix
Depends: python3, python3-tk, libimobiledevice-utils
Description: Read-only iOS device support diagnostics
 iFix displays non-identifying device model and software details for support.
 It does not change device settings or management enrollment.
 This package excludes the archived macOS utilities.
